Montreal, Stats Perform AI, Twelve Labs Korea-US, ChatGPT + sports analysis 2024 ESPN- World Records: 100m 9.58 (Bolt 2009), 200m 19.19 (Bolt 2009), 800m 1:40.91 (Rudisha 2012), marathon 2:00:35 (Kiptum 2023 Chicago), pole vault 6.26m (Duplantis 2024), shot put 23.56m (Crouser 2023), Phelps 23 Olympic golds (all-time), Djokovic 24 Slams (men), Pogačar 3 TdF (2020/21/24), Naoya Inoue P4P 2024- Culture: 2022 Qatar World Cup $220B (highest ever), 2026 WC 48-team format US+Canada+Mexico host, Title IX 1972 (US gender equity), Caitlin Clark NCAA basketball record 3,951 points 2024, Taylor Swift × Travis Kelce 2023-24 cultural moment, 2018 US PASPA struck (sports betting legalized) -> $120B+ wagered annually US, global $200B+, esports market $2B+ + 540M viewers (Newzoo 2024), Faker 4x League Worlds (2013/2015/2016/2023) Ten falsifiable predictions (P_avg = 0.740; Strong/Medium/Weak = 7/3/0)including AI coach mainstream major sport 2028 (P=0.85, Strong),wearable 80%+ athletes 2028 (P=0.85, Strong), AI training plan standard2028 (P=0.85, Strong), CGM elite athletes mainstream 2027 (P=0.85,Strong), AI mental coach standard 2028 (P=0.85, Strong), AI refereemajor sport 2028 (P=0.85, Strong), sports betting global $300B 2027(P=0.85, Strong), marathon official sub-2:00 2030 (P=0.55, Medium),100m WR < 9.50 2030 (P=0.45, Medium), esports Olympic official 2032(P=0.45, Medium). BLOCK D 5/5 = 100% COMPLETE FINALE. ITU 43-vertex polytope nowdistributes: Block A 10 (physics) + Block B 6 (life) + Block C 6(social-humanities-arts) + Block D 5 (engineering) + Pre-extension 16(engineering/cognitive). All 27 main extension papers complete. Pass-1extension cumulative: 13/15 = 86.7%. Remaining: Block E (2 papers: #44ITU mathematical rigor categorical, #45 ITU falsification experiments,Phase 324-339), then Tier 0 v4.0 Pass-1 FINALE Phase 340-345. Pass-1interpretive synthesis.",2026,Terada,Zenodo (CERN European Organization for Nuclear Research),10.5281/zenodo.20266346,,https://doi.org/10.5281/