R4000,"Exclusive copyright license to use the 'Playboy' trademarks, service marks, images, designs, patterns, graphics, symbols and the 'Rabbit Head Design' to design, create, promote, market, advertise, sell, operate, maintain and distribute branded real money mobile game apps such as rummy, poker and fantasy sports to individual players through iOS and Android app stores.",,2021,RoyaltyStat,RoyaltyStat,10.34675/l38949,,https://doi.org/10.34675/l38949,und,datacite:Text/ | openaire:Other literature type,datacite;openaire,2,False,True,False,,,,,
