R4928,Vanderbilt University Poll: Tennessee Poll Fall 2018,President Donald Trump job performance (1); Congress job performance (1); Tennessee State Legislature job performance (1); Governor Bill Haslam job performance (1); Senator Lamar Alexander job performance (1); Senator Bob Corker job performance (1); opinion of public figures (4); Tennessee state government priorities (12); Governor Bill Lee's priorities (12); economic situation of the country (1); economic situation of Tennessee (1); Trump changing Washington (1); Trump telling the truth (1); views of bipartisanship (1); feelings about national government performance (1); feelings about state government performance (1); tariffs (1); illegal immigrants (2); health care system (1); state Medicaid expansion (1); legal immigrants (1); personal financial situation (1); federal government help to rural vs. urban areas (1); state government help to rural vs. urban areas (1); opioid addiction (2); border security (1); sports betting (1); public school priorities (1); vocational/technical education (1); school vouchers (1); undocumented immigrants (1); trust in media (1).,2019,Vanderbilt University,Roper Center for Public Opinion Research,10.25940/roper-31115720,,https://doi.org/10.25940/roper-31115720,,datacite:Other/Study,datacite,1,False,True,False,,,,,
