R5217,กระแสฟตบอลโลก ป 2014 กบทศนคตทมตอการพนนฟตบอล ของนกศกษาในจงหวดนครปฐม,"The purpose of this research aims to (1) explore popular to watch the world cup the year of 2014 students in Nakhon Pathom province (2) identification of popularity in the world cup team of students in Nakhon Pathom. According to personal characteristics (3) study on the influence on attitudes towards student football gambling in Nakhon Pathom province. Population samples from calculation with the guideline of Cochran for 460 items from student in Nakhon Pathom with convenience sampling method. The statistics used in data analysis were percentage, mean, standard deviation and multiple regression analysis with MPLUS program Version 7. The results showed that the students with the popularity of football watching is less (42.61 percentage), with the world cup football gambling attention 20.87 percentage. A survey of students' attitude towards football gambling in Nakhon Pathom province found that the attitude that received a high evaluation in three first order (1) football gambling make football more enjoyable (Mean = 3.76) (2) gambling football will make it into a good group of friends (Mean = 3.72) and (3) football gambling as a way to earn money easy (Mean = 3.54). Most popular football teams in three consecutive starts, including the Brazilian national team (38.26 percentage), Germany (17.17 percentage) and Spain (10.00 percentage). Research finding from multiple regression analysis showed that attitudes that affect gambling football gambling football make the more rich (X2) (b=0.31), football gambling is the fashion nowadays teenagers (X4) (b=0.06) ,family members and friends that gambling would make the influence played by (X5) (b=-0.14), playing football in students are normal (X6) (b=0.02) and group gambling will make good friends (X7) (b=-0.04) with the forecasting accuracy of prediction of 0.90. Article history : Accepted 10 March 2014 SIMILARITY INDEX = 0.00",2018,Rittiboonchai,Journal of Management Science Nakhon Pathom Rajabhat University,10.14456/jmsnpru.2014.7,,https://doi.org/10.14456/jmsnpru.2014.7,th,datacite:Text/Article | openalex:article,openalex;datacite,2,False,False,False,,R6500;R6505,,,
R5218,Ranking and forecasting serie A 1934-2016 soccer outcomes through bivariate Poisson regression,"Soccer rankings, based on previous performance of each team, have several important roles with a crucial impact on betting such as to provide an objective indication of the strength of each team (McHale and Davies, 2007). Typically tournaments are scheduled so to avoid the pairing of the best teams from the early stages. They also provide an efficient tool to predict outcomes in order to properly fix the betting odds through an objective criterion. The football betting market is based on fixed odds that generally remain unchanged in relation to bettor demand (Goddard, 2005; Goddard and Asimakopoulos, 2004). The efficiency of the estimates of the bookmakers could add a risk of exposure that may generate ample opportunities to uncover inefficiencies in the market. In the previous literature, the approach of modeling the goals scored and conceded by each team showed to be more flexible than directly modeling win-draw-lose match results (Dobson and Goddard, 2003; Goddard, 2005; Lasek et al., 2013). Bivariate Poisson regression (Dixon and Coles, 1997) is used to estimate ranking models on the Italian Serie A historical data from 1934 to 2016. Promising and encouraging forecasting performance is achieved tuning appropriately the reference period of the data used to estimate the model. Such a model is flexible to the introduction of additional team specific covariates that can improve its predictive capabilities.",2018,Roberto Benedetti,Statistica Applicata,10.26398/ijas.0030-007,,https://doi.org/10.26398/ijas.0030-007,eng,openaire:Article,openaire,1,False,True,False,,,,,
