R5456,A Survey on the Illegal Sport Gambling of Male Middle and High School Students,"The purpose of the study was to investigate the status quo of the illegal sport gambling of male middle and high school students. To collect data, a survey with 719 middle and high school students was conducted in Seoul, Kyeonggi province, and Chungnam province. The survey was to investigate subjects",2017,Kim,Korean Journal of Sports Science,10.35159/kjss.2017.06.26.3.23,,https://doi.org/10.35159/kjss.2017.06.26.3.23,en,crossref:journal-article | openalex:article | s2:Review,openalex;s2;crossref,3,False,False,False,,,,,
