R5828,Different Forms of Gambling and its Impacts; a Qualitative Research,,2016,Maarefvand,,,,,,s2:,s2,1,False,False,False,,,,,
R5829,The Effect of Different Types of Soils on the Germination Rate of the Watercress Seeds (Nasturtium Officinal),"Discover unparalleled betting experiences with IDBET, your go-to destination for top-tier sports betting and thrilling casino games. Enjoy secure transactions, generous bonuses, and a wide variety of betting options tailored to elevate your gaming journey. Join IDBET today for the ultimate online betting adventure.",2016,MAHMOUD,International Journal of Applied and Physical Sciences,10.20469/ijaps.2.50004-1,,https://doi.org/10.20469/ijaps.2.50004-1,en,openalex:article,openalex,1,False,False,False,,,,,
R5830,Betting on Sports,,2016,Mantel,CQ Press eBooks,10.4135/cqresrre20161028,,https://doi.org/10.4135/cqresrre20161028,en,crossref:book | openaire:Book | openalex:book | s2:Book,openalex;s2;crossref;openaire,4,False,False,False,,,,,
R5831,"Game On: Past Year Gambling, Gambling-Related Problems, and Fantasy Sports Gambling Among College Athletes and Non-athletes.","College students experience higher rates of gambling-related problems than most other population segments, including the general population. Although Division I (D1) athletes often have more at stake than the average student if and when they gamble (e.g., the potential to lose their athletic eligibility), relatively few studies have assessed the gambling behavior of this population and none have specifically assessed fantasy sports gambling. We conducted a study to examine gambling behavior (past-year gambling, gambling-related problems, and fantasy sport gambling) among a sample (N = 692) of college students at a private religiously affiliated university in the Southwest US. The sample for our study was unique in that approximately 30 % of the participants were D1 athletes. We compared the gambling behavior among three groups based on the athlete status: D1 athletes, club/intramural/recreational (CIR) athletes, and non-athletes (NAs). Compared to females in our sample, males observed higher rates of past year gambling, fantasy sports participation, fantasy sports gambling, and gambling-related problems. Among males, we found that CIR athletes observed the highest rates of past year gambling and fantasy sports participation and D1 athletes observed higher rates than NAs. We did not find differences in fantasy sport gambling and past year gambling-related problems based on athlete status in males or females.",2016,Martin,Journal of gambling studies,10.1007/s10899-015-9561-y,26183955,https://doi.org/10.1007/s10899-015-9561-y,eng,crossref:journal-article | europepmc:Comparative Study;Journal Article|src=MED | openaire:Article | openalex:article | pubmed:Comparative Study;Journal Article | s2:JournalArticle;Study,pubmed;europepmc;openalex;s2;crossref;openaire,6,False,False,False,,,,,
R5832,Sports Betting - Tipster Platform,,2016,Martins,,,,,,s2:,s2,1,False,False,False,,,,,
R5833,Análisis de la satisfacción laboral con la supervisión y las condiciones laborales en el sector de los salones de juego y apuestas deportivas en Zaragoza,"El objetivo del presente Trabajo Fin de Grado, es conocer el nivel de satisfacción laboral con la supervisión y las condiciones de trabajo en los empleados de los establecimientos del sector de los salones de juegos y apuestas deportivas en Zaragoza (España), un sector muy poco investigado en lo que a satisfacción laboral se refiere. Para indagar acerca de este tema, se realiza una revisión del marco teórico de la satisfacción laboral, a continuación, se llevó a cabo un estudio exploratorio en una muestra de 24 trabajadores, que fueron reclutados utilizando un método de muestreo no probabilístico de bola de nieve; la encuesta suministrada se diseñó utilizando la mayor parte de los ítems del Cuestionario de Satisfacción Laboral S10/12 de Meliá y Peiró (1998) y se añadieron algunos ítems más, para intentar adaptarla al perfil de estos trabajadores. Finalmente se ofrecen los apartados de discusión y de conclusiones sobre los resultados obtenidos.",2016,Martínez Zapata,Universidad de Zaragoza,,,http://zaguan.unizar.es/record/58980,esl/spa,openaire:Bachelor thesis,openaire,1,False,True,False,,,,,
R5834,"La quiniela celebra con pasión y emoción su 70 cumpleaños: RK firma la campaña, que se basa en historias de Quinielistas y tendrá continuidad","Una de las apuestas deportivas mas antiguas de Espana, la Quiniela, celebra su setenta cumpleanos en este 2016. Para conmemorar este aniversario, la marca de Loterias y Apuestas del Estado ha confiado en la agencia que viene firmando sus ultimas campanas, RK, para el desarrollo de una emotiva y pasional creatividad apoyada en historias de quinielistas. Diego Martinez-Casariego, director creativo de la agencia, ha hablado con Anuncios sobre la campana.",2016,Martínez,Anuncios: Semanario de publicidad y marketing,,,,es,openalex_non_en:article,openalex_non_en,1,False,False,False,,,,,
R5835,Primjena metoda dubinske analize za predviđanje rezultata sportskih događaja,"Područje primjene dubinske analize podataka danas postaje sve šire pa tako i obuhvaća domenu igara na sreću. U ovom radu dubinska analiza podataka primijenjena je na stvarni, povijesni skup podataka o nogometnim utakmicama i podacima vezanim uz sportsko klađenje na njih. Nad tim skupom provedene su sve faze dubinske analize: od početnog čišćenja i pripreme podataka, preko primjene jedne od metoda dubinske analize podataka, do izrade krajnjeg modela i završne analize. Metoda koja je pobliže opisana i korištena je multinomijalna logistička regresija kao generalizacija obične logističke regresije. In recent years data mining application domains are becoming broader and thus include sports betting and lottery games. In this paper, data mining techniques are applied to the real, historical data set of football games and betting odds. Provided data set went through all of data mining phases, which include: cleaning and preparing data, applying one of data mining methods, creating a model and providing final analysis. Data mining function, which is described and used, is multinomial logistic regression, as generalisation of logistic regression.",2016,Marušić,Sveučilište u Zagrebu. Fakultet elektrotehnike i računarstva.,,,https://repozitorij.fer.unizg.hr/islandora/object/fer:1491,hr,openaire:Master thesis | openalex:dissertation,openalex;openaire,2,False,False,False,,,,,
R5836,The university of sydneySocial-Economic Impacts of Sports Betting on Ugandan Youth. The case of Mbale Youth .,"Sports betting activities, particularly among youth, is increasing rapidly in Ugandan. The aim of this study was to determine the motivation for sports betting among Ugandan youth, and the social economic impact of this form of gambling. In a cross sectional quantitative research design, a questionnaire data was obtained from a sample of 181 youth attending betting houses in the Mbale district. Results indicated that that most youths were motivated by the desire to win money. Findings also revealed that Ugandan youth socially and economically benefited from sports betting. The study concludes by recommending that even if findings do not show the negative impacts of gambling on youth, there is need for stricter laws to avert any future negative implications.",2016,Masaba,The Journal of Gambling Business and Economics,10.5750/jgbe.v10i2.1205,,https://doi.org/10.5750/jgbe.v10i2.1205,en,crossref:journal-article | openaire:Article | openalex:article | s2:,openalex;s2;crossref;openaire,4,False,False,False,,,,,
