R5971,Construction of Sports Lottery Security Management System,"The purpose of this study was to analyze construction of China sports lottery security management system which can provide references for sports lottery issuing. In the last two decades,China sports lottery has been developed very quickly,but security management system hasn't been constructed. Without such a system,it is very hard to widely manage and efficiently control national and regional sports lottery security. Based on the comparative analysis and logical analysis,this paper defined that the security management system of sports lottery is a kind of planed,coordinated,communicated and controlled system for sport lottery's hardware and software safety. The hardware and software include organization,brand,employee,fund,goods,technology,data,and place. The system includes the elements of subject,object and support. Using process management as a longitudinal axis and function management as a transverse axis,the security management system can be constructed,which is strategic,systematic,multi-leveled and dynamic. This system have many functional applications such as identifying the security and risk elements,managing the security and risk elements according to different classifications,assessing the level of security,warning and controlling the security events. This well designed system can wholly manage and control sports lottery security.",2015,Ai,Beijing Tiyu Daxue xuebao,,,,en,openalex:article | s2:,openalex;s2,2,False,False,False,,,,,
