R6128,The Ethics Evolution of Fantasy Sports Journalism,,2015,Loop,Journal of Sports Management and Commercialization,10.18848/2381-6937/cgp/v06i02/59424,,https://doi.org/10.18848/2381-6937/cgp/v06i02/59424,en,crossref:journal-article | openaire:Article; Other literature type | openalex:article | s2:,openalex;s2;crossref;openaire,4,False,False,False,,,,,
