R6468,Research on Sports Lottery Development in Shanxi Province,"Objective: Compared with the other provinces,the sales of sports lottery issuance in Shanxi province is far more less. These papers,through analysis on sports lottery consumer behavior,this paper tries to find out further expand sales. The method of questionnaire and mathematical statistics is adopted. The result shows that92. 7% of consumers on male,45 to 59,consumers (46. 3%),junior middle school and high school degrees below (overall 63. 9,other professionals accounted for 37. 9% of overall,monthly income consumers accounted for 90. 9% in 1291- 3500. Conclusion: Shanxi Province sports lottery consumers more male,age is given priority to with middle age,and income level is not high,no more fixed professionals and gives priority to with low degrees,and education level and income level to purchase lottery tickets.",2014,Tian,Bulletin of Sport Science & Technology,,,,en,openalex:article | s2:,openalex;s2,2,False,False,False,,,,,
