R6483,Sociocultural Influences on Gambling and Alcohol Use Among Native Americans in the United States,,2014,Wolf,Journal of Gambling Studies,10.1007/s10899-014-9512-z,25408467,https://doi.org/10.1007/s10899-014-9512-z,en,citations:article,citations,1,True,False,False,reference of Tran 2024,,,,
R6484,Gambling disorder: Estimated prevalence rates and risk factors in Macao.,"An excessive, problematic gambling pattern has been regarded as a mental disorder in the Diagnostic and Statistical Manual for Mental Disorders (DSM) for more than 3 decades (American Psychiatric Association [APA], 1980). In this study, its latest prevalence in Macao (one of very few cities with legalized gambling in China and the Far East) was estimated with 2 major changes in the diagnostic criteria, suggested by the 5th edition of DSM (APA, 2013): (a) removing the ""Illegal Act"" criterion, and (b) lowering the threshold for diagnosis. A random, representative sample of 1,018 Macao residents was surveyed with a phone poll design in January 2013. After the 2 changes were adopted, the present study showed that the estimated prevalence rate of gambling disorder was 2.1% of the Macao adult population. Moreover, the present findings also provided empirical support to the application of these 2 recommended changes when assessing symptoms of gambling disorder among Chinese community adults. Personal risk factors of gambling disorder, namely being male, having low education, a preference for casino gambling, as well as high materialism, were identified.",2014,Wu,Psychology of Addictive Behaviors,10.1037/a0037603,25134026,https://doi.org/10.1037/a0037603,en,citations:article,citations,1,True,False,False,reference of Tran 2024,,,,
R6485,Internet Gambling Among Community Adults and University Students in Macao,,2014,Wu,Journal of Gambling Studies,10.1007/s10899-014-9451-8,24596073,https://doi.org/10.1007/s10899-014-9451-8,en,citations:article,citations,1,True,False,False,reference of Tran 2024,,,,
R6486,Carry on winning: the gamblers' fallacy creates hot hand effects in online gambling.,"People suffering from the hot-hand fallacy unreasonably expect winning streaks to continue whereas those suffering from the gamblers' fallacy unreasonably expect losing streaks to reverse. We took 565,915 sports bets made by 776 online gamblers in 2010 and analyzed all winning and losing streaks up to a maximum length of six. People who won were more likely to win again (apparently because they chose safer odds than before) whereas those who lost were more likely to lose again (apparently because they chose riskier odds than before). However, selection of safer odds after winning and riskier ones after losing indicates that online sports gamblers expected their luck to reverse: they suffered from the gamblers' fallacy. By believing in the gamblers' fallacy, they created their own hot hands.",2014,Xu,Cognition,10.1016/j.cognition.2014.01.002,24549140,https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cognition.2014.01.002,eng,"europepmc:Research Support, Non-U.S. Gov't;Journal Article|src=MED | openaire:Article | openalex:article | pubmed:Journal Article;Research Support, Non-U.S. Gov't | s2:JournalArticle",pubmed;europepmc;openalex;s2;openaire,5,False,False,False,,,,,
R6487,Principle of sports tipping point and its inspiration for the Nan Jing youth Olympic games,,2014,Xu,,,,,,s2:Review,s2,1,False,False,False,,,,,
R6488,Study on Chongqing Sports Industrial Structure and Disposition of Human Capital,"There is a close relation between human capital and industrial structure. By discussing industrial structure and human capital of Chongqing sports, this paper attempts to explore the growth point for development of sports industry, the rational allocation between the industrial structure and human resources. The result shows that sports tourism industry, sports industry, sports lottery industry and leisure sports industry will become the optimal direction for the development of sports industry.",2014,Yang,Open Journal of Social Sciences,10.4236/jss.2014.27010,,https://doi.org/10.4236/jss.2014.27010,en,openaire:Article | openalex:article | s2:,openalex;s2;openaire,3,False,False,False,,,,,
R6489,Gambling and Mobile Money Payments: A Case Study of Sports Betting in Uganda (Final Report),"The usage of mobile money payment systems has become a popular means of transmitting money across different regions in Uganda because of its low transfer charges, quick and easy process, and availability among the unbanked and rural communities of the population. Around 400,000 customers are currently using mobile payment facilities processing around UGX 1.3 billion (US$ 0.5 million) per day. In spite of Uganda’s rising youth unemployment, which would seem to indicate that the youth do not have spare cash, the reality is that the country’s youth--especially those in urban areas--increasingly participate in sports betting using cash as well as mobile money payments.Nevertheless, there is a knowledge gap with regard to the drivers of sports betting (especially the mobile money payments system) and the socioeconomic implications of this phenomenon. Whereas some betters strike it rich, others continuously lose cash but are not about to stop participating, thereby keeping them in a vicious circle of poverty. This study examines the role of mobile money payments in the practice of gambling in general. Specifically, the study sought to examine the role of mobile money payments (making bets and receipt of payments) in the execution of sports betting in Uganda. An exploratory mixed- methods (qualitative and quantitative) research design was employed. We administered a questionnaire and collected more data using qualitative approaches.The reasons for gambling among youth are not different from those for adult gambling. Young people who gamble report that fun, the opportunity to win money, and the excitement of gambling on games are the top reasons that they participate. Approximately 5.7% of shops offer online betting facilities. 55% of respondents use both cash and mobile money payments to place bets and to receive payments. Approximately only 25% (37) out of 104 sports betting shops in the country are licensed. This finding is corroborated by Okoth (2013) who reported that sports betting is a booming business in the country although most of the companies are operating illegally, which has significant policy implications for the regulatory environment within which sports betting takes place.",2014,Yawe,"eScholarship, University of California",,,https://escholarship.org/content/qt06x163x8/qt06x163x8.pdf,und,openaire:Article,openaire,1,False,True,False,,,,,
R6490,[Online-gambling - new hazard potential?].,"Dass Glücksspiele und Wettsport potentiell abhängig machen können, steht spätesten seit Erscheinen der neuen amerikanischen psychiatrischen Klassifikation, DSM V, in welchem Glückspielsucht dem gleichen Kapitel zugeordnet wird wie auch substanzgebundene Süchte, außer Streit. Auch die neurobiologischen Vorgänge im Gehirn weisen bei allen Suchterkrankungen Ähnlichkeiten auf. Durch die weltweite Verbreitung des Internets verlagert sich nun auch das Glücksspiel zunehmend in den virtuellen Raum. Das Suchtpotential scheint beim Online-Glücksspiel allerdings höher zu sein als offline, was sich auch beim Patientengut der Ambulanz für Spielsucht in Linz wiederspiegelt. Dieser Umstand stellt für Betroffene, Behandler, Glücksspielanbieter aber auch Gesetzgeber und der Gesellschaft als Ganzes eine Herausforderung dar. Since the new American psychiatric classification, DSM V, was released, bringing together substance-related disorders and gambling disorder into one chapter, the addictive potential of gambling and sports wagering is beyond all question. Even the neurobiological processes of the brain show similarities in all addictive disorders. Gambling is more and more shifted into the cyberspace owing to the global expansion of the internet. The addictive potential of online-gambling seems to be higher than offline, though, which is also reflected by the patient population of the outpatient clinic for gambling addiction in Linz. This fact poses a challenge for the persons affected, therapists, gambling providers, legislator the society as a whole.",2014,Yazdi,Psychiatria Danubina,,25377378,https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/25377378/,ger,europepmc:Journal Article;English Abstract|src=MED | openaire:Article; Conference object | openalex:other | pubmed:English Abstract;Journal Article | s2:JournalArticle,pubmed;europepmc;openalex;s2;openaire,5,False,False,False,,,,,
R6491,ONLINE-GAMBLING - NEW HAZARD POTENTIAL? GLÜCKSSPIELE IM INTERNET - NEUES GEFAHRENPOTENTIAL?,"SUMMARY Since the new American psychiatric classification, DSM V, was released, bringing together substance-related disorders and gambling disorder into one chapter, the addictive potential of gambling and sports wagering is beyond all question. Even the neurobiological processes of the brain show similarities in all addictive disorders. Gambling is more and more shifted into the cyberspace owing to the global expansion of the internet. The addictive potential of online-gambling seems to be higher than offline, though, which is also reflected by the patient population of the outpatient clinic for gambling addiction in Linz. This fact poses a challenge for the persons affected, therapists, gambling providers, legislator the society as a whole.",2014,Yazdi,,,,,,s2:,s2,1,False,False,False,,,,,
R6492,ti yu cai piao gong yi jin he li fen pei dui ji lin sheng ti yu shi ye fa zhan de ying xiang,"本文对吉林省体育彩票公益金分配现状进行全面的调查分析,了解其发展的现状和特点、问题和不足,提出了建设性的意见及相应的发展对策,为吉林省体育彩票业和地方经济及体育事业的健康发展提出合理化建议。",2014,Yichun,cai zhi,,,,cy,openalex_non_en:article,openalex_non_en,1,False,False,False,,,,,
R6493,A Comparative Study of the Factors Influencing Both Sports Majors' and NonSports Majors' Intention of Buying Sports Lottery,"This paper, based on the self-conducted questionnaire, does a survey of the factors that influence the students' intention of buying sports lottery and then makes a comparative study of them. These students include 123 sports-majors and 628 non-sports majors from 10 provinces or cities. Results indicate that the scores of economic utility for sports majors are significantly higher than non-sports ones, that the scores of risk preference of male lottery buyers are significantly higher than those of female ones and that the families' buying sports lottery has some influence on students' buying cognition and external information. Then some suggestions are given in the paper, which are as follows: cultivating students to construct good views of value and weaken the economic utility of lottery, preventing from and interfering in students' pursuit of lottery risk stimulation, and creating favorable family atmosphere to help students have a rational attitude towards lottery-buying.",2014,Yuan,Journal of Hengshui University,,,,en,openalex:article | s2:Review,openalex;s2,2,False,False,False,,,,,
R6494,Modern Horse Racing Industry under the Background of Economic Transformation and Upgrading of China's Construction and Countermeasures,"Accelerate the improvement of the socialist market economic system and accelerate the transformation of the mode of economic development has become the consensus of the community, the development of China's modern horse industry also went to the critical period of change in mode of development, reform and development mode,with the development of our country's Jockey Club, foundation of the development of society in modern horse industry has formed. But the development of the modern horse industry in China is facing the industrial development level, industrial chain is relatively single, low value-added products, combined with the construction of sports lottery and the race of the new system is an innovation and try, new opportunity and new breakthrough industry new development mode is bound to join the traditional horse industry bring development, is the breakthrough in the development of China horse industry bottleneck, a new path to change the extensive mode of development.",2014,Yun-jia,,,,,en,openalex:article | s2:,openalex;s2,2,False,False,False,,,,,
R6495,From the Market to the Public Welfare: Research on the Development of Sports Lottery Market and the Use of the Public Welfare Fund in Zhejiang,"By using the method of literature review,taking Zhejiang province lottery based on statistical data,the paper analyzes the development of sports lottery,market characteristics,development speed,the lottery public welfare fund raising,investment and performance status in Zhejiang. The result shows that sports lottery sales rise and lottery product has diversification,but the lottery market share decreased year by year in Zhejiang,folk lottery market spread,nuisance,sport for allinvestment structure is not reasonable,the amount of public welfare fund precipitation is larger,supervision and restraint mechanism is not perfect,part of the lottery public welfare fund is diverted and misappropriated. In view of the above problems,it puts forward corresponding countermeasures and suggestions.",2014,Zhan-ku,Sports Science Research,,,,en,openalex:article | s2:Review,openalex;s2,2,False,False,False,,,,,
R6496,Chinese new pattern urbanization process medium and small towns sports industrial development strategy research,,2014,Zhang,,,,,,s2:,s2,1,False,False,False,,,,,
R6497,The Game Theory Analysis of Sports Lottery Center's Integrity Problem,"Attempt to give the response to the suspicion of lottery players that sports lottery center might cheat in the gambling, this paper establishes a game theory model from the aspects of the objective and subjective integrity respectively to demonstrate the integrity to sports lottery center, the result is as follows:(1) From the aspect of the objective integrity, sports lottey center is in good faith and the result of the gambling is random.(2) From the aspect of the subjective integrity, demonstrates that in the one-period game, there exsits a Prisoner's Dilemma in the choices of lottery center and lottery players, whereas in the long term, the strategies combination of sports lottey center's not cheating and lottery players' s keeping trust is efficient with the premise that the players trust center at the begginning of the gambling. Thus it proposes three recommendations of sports lottery center to improve its credibility, including strengthening the propagandize of the integrity of sports lottery center's ernies, developing the information disclosure mechanism of sports lottery center, and drafting the management regulation of sports lottey sales outlays' behavior.",2014,Zhang,Sichuan Sports Science,,,,en,openalex:article | s2:,openalex;s2,2,False,False,False,,,,,
R6498,Behavior of watching sports media and playing betting games for high School and college students,research,2014,Özsoy,Hitit University Institutional Repository,,,,tr,openalex:article,openalex,1,False,False,False,,,,,
R6499,The Impact of Televising World Cup Football on Productivity Loss and Volume of Gambling in Bangkok and Vicinity,"This study aims at measuring the impacts of televising World Cup football late at night on: (a) work loss and productivity loss, and (b) change in the volume of gambling among the working population in Bangkok and vicinity The researcher employed telephone survey by calling residential numbers in area code 02, which were picked proportionately from the TOT and True Corporation's database in mid 2006. Among 1,603 respondents (from the same number of sampled households), 1,239 households had at least one member that watched some of the live televised football during that period.Work loss consisted of two components: (a) work time loss from absence and tardiness, and (b) productivity loss among those that were working, but at lower intensity and/or quality The study found that each part accounted for about half of the loss, the total of which was estimated to be around 2,030-2,066 Baht per month per worker for the estimated 2.42 million workers that followed the World Cup event. The loss was considered significant as it was equivalent to more than 11 times the minimum wage.The study on gambling found that, in the preceding 12 months prior to the World Cup, 41 percent of the respondents reportedly engaged in certain types of gambling, amounting to approximately 1,964 million Baht per month. During the World Cup, the volume of the non-football gambling was about 20 percent below the pre-World Cup level. Interestingly, only six percent of the respondents reported participation in football betting. However, that figure was sufficient to create a surge of football betting volume that was so large that it made the total volume of gambling almost three times the pre-World Cup volume. This result underscores the importance of football betting and the fact that it could have a severe impact on those, albeit a small number of, households that had increased their gambling volume substantially during this major sport event.",2014,ระนอง,Journal of Public and Private Management,,,,en,openalex:article,openalex,1,False,False,False,,R7345;R7346,,,
R6500,拥抱阳光 放飞梦想——2014年北京青少年网球夏令营,去年营仪式上隆隆的锣鼓声仿佛还在耳边回荡时隔一年，北京青少年网球夏令营的大幕再次被拉开。 夏令营由国家体育总局青少司、北京市体育局主办，北京市网球运动管理中心承办，是“来之于民、用之于民”体育彩票公益基金全国青少年网球夏令营舌动其中之一，旨在增强青少年体质，培养对网球运动的兴趣，养成良好饮食和运动习惯，培养自我管理和吃苦耐劳精神为目标，全面提高青少年的综合素质。活动始终秉承“选好苗子、着眼未来、培养兴趣、打好基础、注重宣传”。同时也为深入贯彻《中共中央、国务院关于加强青少年体育增强青少年体质的意见》精神，引导和动员广大青少年积极参加体育舌动，增强体质、磨练意志、培养兴趣。,2014,卢振宇,网球天地,,,,zh,openalex_non_en:article,openalex_non_en,1,False,False,False,,R5217;R6505,,,
R6501,白领和大学生不宜过度“下注”世界杯,巴西世界杯正在让全世界球迷享受着四年一度的足球盛宴。就连对足球毫无兴趣的我的助理们也都在讨论世界杯的比赛。原来吸引她们的不是足球，而是足球彩票。据说足球彩票已经成为白领圈的一种时尚，“今天你赌谁赢”甚至成了许多朋友、同事、同学等见面必谈的话题。,2014,唐骏,中国经济周刊,,,,zh,openalex_non_en:article,openalex_non_en,1,False,False,False,,,,,
R6502,体彩20年“最美体彩人”谱写诚信之歌,"今年是中国体育彩票发行20周年。20年来,体彩发展取得巨大成就,为国家公益事业做出了巨大贡献;20年来,更有无数体彩人诚信为本默默奉献,奠定了体彩发展的坚固基石,戴玉银、王荣华、张建顺、徐金库、李菊妹……他们的名字出现在＂全国道德模范评选＂中,成为全国人民学习的榜样;体彩诚信的故事登上了春晚舞台,入围高考作文题,成为社会热点……＂最美体彩人＂在平凡的岗位上,谱写出一曲曲诚信之歌,成就了一份不平凡的事业。",2014,张慧慈,少林与太极,,,,ja,openalex_non_en:article,openalex_non_en,1,False,False,False,,,,,
R6503,事权、财权与政策规制：对中国体育公共财政的批判性阐释,中国体育财政正在向着民生化转型，但体育部门仅对财政资金的使用范围作出规定，而不注重政策执行的适用性和关联性，其弊端逐渐显现。通过对体育公共服务权责分配、资金流动以及法规框架的综合分析，认为体育事业系统已经习惯性地将竞技体育作为工作重心，竞技成绩仍是衡量体育部门绩效的最主要指标；中央体育彩票公益金被过多地使用在其他社会保障方面，地方体育彩票公益金难以到达基层社区。因此，建议扩大体育事业在中央体育彩票公益金中的使用比例；体育部门应走出封闭、孤立的状态，逐步形成多方合作、权责明确的体育公共财政系统。,2014,易剑东,Acta Scientiarum Naturalium Universitatis Sunyatseni,,,,zh,openalex_non_en:article,openalex_non_en,1,False,False,False,,,,,
R6504,苏、锡、宁体育彩票营销模式对比研究,"通过文献资料、数理统计、走访调查等研究方法在对苏州、无锡、南京三市体育彩票销售情况分析的基础上对三地体育彩票营销模式进行了对比分析。调查发现：三市在彩票营销组织架构上存在不同,在营销模式上各具特色,苏州凸显渠道建设,南京彰显整合营销,无锡则重视新产品开发营销,并指出整体存在的问题：营销水平不高、自组织营销缺失、营销人才队伍建设不足、营销针对性不强、站点生存生态恶化等。在此基础上提出了体育彩票营销的对策：建立公益先行的体育彩票营销概念思路;建立基于人群的体育彩票营销策略;建立人情化的渠道建设思路;完善体育彩票营销组织架构;调动体育彩票销售站点、员的营销热情;建立基于本国赛事的竞彩制度。",2014,李坚,南京体育学院学报：社会科学版,,,,zh,openalex_non_en:article,openalex_non_en,1,False,False,False,,,,,
R6505,拒绝意外——2014年“中国体育彩票杯”中国东川泥石流国际汽车越野赛暨全国汽车越野系列赛东川分站赛赛事报道,,2014,王铮,越野世界,,,,zh,openalex_non_en:article,openalex_non_en,1,False,False,False,,R5217;R6500,,,
R6506,天津体彩“纵深”行公益,"天津体彩中心长期以来秉承着“来之于民、用之于民”的发行宗旨,多年来坚持支持公益事业,体彩公益金不仅用于竞技体育和全民健身事业上,还渗透到如助学、扶贫、提供社会保障资金等社会的方方面面。天津体彩党总支部更是积极践行党建活动,深入践行了党的群众路线方针,真正把体育彩票“来之于民、用之于民”的公益本质落到实处。",2014,葛江霞,社会与公益,,,,ja,openalex_non_en:article,openalex_non_en,1,False,False,False,,,,,
R6507,“体彩印”体育公益的标签 第五届“体彩杯”全民健身运动会开幕,“把‘中国体育彩票捐赠’的字样，标注在体彩资助的健身工程、健身器械上，可以让老百姓一目了然的知道他们购买的体育彩票，筹集的公益金都花在哪儿了，除了是宣传体彩公益属性的需要，也是对彩民、对社会负责任的表现。,2014,葛江露,社会与公益,,,,zh,openalex_non_en:article,openalex_non_en,1,False,False,False,,,,,
R6508,불법스포츠도박과 승부조작사건의 비판적 접근과 민사법적 접근방법을 통한 미래적 함의,,2014,남,,,,,,s2:Review,s2,1,False,False,False,,,,,
R6509,불법스포츠도박과 승부조작사건의 비판적 접근과 민사법적 접근방법을 통한 미래적 함의,"The purpose of the study was to figure out critical approach and progressive opinion on illegal sport gambling and match fixing through civil law. The data were collected through literature review of law related books, precedent researches. The data were analyzed with two sport management majored professors, a civil law majored professor and two Ph.D. candidates of sport marketing major. After the analysis, four outcomes were deducted. First, the regulations against illegal sports gambling was not relevant illegal sports gambling reality. Second, financial loss of the sportstoto were discovered by illegal sports gamblers. Third, the sportstoto had the exclusive rights of its name for all or even parts of it. Last, the media, used a word ‘toto’ had the liability for damages of the sportstoto. This research presented how to secure the company as a civil victim and propose several suggestions for the Sportstoto and to contribute on healthy sport leisure culture in Korea.",2014,남상백,,,,,ko,openalex:article,openalex,1,False,False,False,,,,,
R6510,System for managing direct challenges between users in fantasy sports and other games,,2014,다니엘지.,,,,,,s2:,s2,1,False,False,False,,,,,
R6511,사회공헌활동과 기금조성사업의 긍정적 이미지와의 관계: 국민체육진흥공단을 중심으로,"본 연구는 국민체육진흥공단의 사회공헌활동과 기금조성사업(경륜, 경정, 스포츠토토)의 긍정적 이미지와의 관계를 규명하는데 목적이 있다. 이 연구를 위해 국민체육진흥공단 소재지인 올림픽공원을 방문한 일반인을 대상으로 312명의 유효표본으로 분석하였다. 자료처리는 PASW 18.0을 통해 빈도분석(Frequency Analysis), 신뢰도분석(Reliability Analysis), 상관관계분석(Correlation Analysis)과 AMOS 18.0을 통해 확인적 요인분석(Confirmatory Factor Analysis: CFA), 구조방정식모형(Structural Equation Model: SEM) 등을 실시하여 얻은 연구결과는 다음과 같다. 첫째, 국민체육진흥공단의 사회공헌활동(공익적, 자선적, 사회적 활동)은 기금조성사업의 긍정적 이미지에 영향을 미치는 것으로 나타났다. 둘째, 국민체육진흥공단의 사회적 공헌활동이 자선적 공헌활동과 공익적 공헌활동보다 경륜사업의 긍정적인 이미지에 더 영향을 미치는 것으로 나타났다. 셋째, 국민체육진흥공단의 자선적 공헌활동이 공익적 공헌활동과 사회적 공헌활동보다 경정사업의 긍정적인 이미지에 더 영향을 미치는 것으로 나타났다. 넷째, 국민체육진흥공단의 사회적 공헌활동이 공익적 공헌활동보다 스포츠토토 사업의 긍정적인 이미지에 더 영향을 미치는 것으로 나타났다.",2014,문개성,한국체육학회지-인문사회과학,,,,ko,openalex_non_en:article,openalex_non_en,1,False,False,False,,,,,
R6512,"2013 World Taekwondo Grand Prix Final(2013 세계태권도연맹월드태권도그랑프리파이날) 관중의 관람동기, 태권도이미지, 태권도동일시, 태권도충성도의 구조적 관계","The purpose of this study is to examine structural correlation among motivation of viewing, Taekwondo image, Taekwondo identification and Taekwondo loyalty in the audience of 2013 World Taekwondo Grand Prix Final. To attain the goal of this paper, among the audience of ``2013 World Taekwondo Grand Prix Final``, 350 persons who were high school students or older were selected as the subjects of this study, and then, a survey was conducted to them. For sampling, the convenience sampling method was employed, and for responding to the questionnaire, self-administration was used. Among the questionnaire sheets collected, 28 sheets that had been answered unfaithfully, responded omissively, answered duplicatively, or responded unreliably in general were excluded from the subjects of analysis, and then, the rest 322 sheets usable for the analysis were finally selected as valid samples. For data processing, both PASW 18.0 and AMOS 18.0 were utilized to investigate the goodness-of-fit of the model through confirmatory factor analysis, reliability analysis, correlation analysis, and structural equation model analysis and then verify each individual hypothesis. Based on the hypotheses, the study has drawn the following results: first of all, eustress and group affiliation, the subfactors of motivation of viewing, were had a positive effects on their Taekwondo image, but betting on sport had a negative effects on their Taekwondo image, and both aesthetics and vicarious achievement had no significant effects on Taekwondo image. Second, Taekwondo image had a positive effects on Taekwondo identification. Third, Taekwondo image had a positive effects on Taekwondo loyalty. Lastly, Taekwondo identification had a positive effects on Taekwondo loyalty.",2014,박수경,,,,,ko,openalex:article | s2:Review,openalex;s2,2,False,False,False,,,,,
R6513,불법 스포츠토토 참여자들의 도박중독수준에 따른 이용행태 및 합법 스포츠토토 전환의사 차이분석,"본 연구는 불법 스포츠토토 참여자들의 도박중독수준을 진단하고 이용행태와 합법 스포츠토토 전환의사의 관계를 분석하기 위해 불법 스포츠토토에 참여하는 257명을 대상으로 교차분석, x2 검증, 일원변량분석을 실시하였다. 그 결과는 첫째, 모든 집단에서 ‘20~30대’,‘미혼’,‘대졸이하’의 비율이 높게 나타났다. 둘째, 참여빈도는 문제성 위험군에서 ‘주 3회이상’의 비중이, 1회 평균베팅액은 모든 집단에서 ‘3만원이하’의 비율이 높았고, 참여이유로는 비문제성군, 문제성위험군은 ‘높은 배당률’이, 저위험군, 중위험군은 ‘간편한 구매방법’이, 참여경로는 모든 집단에서 ‘주변인 소개’가 가장 높게 나타났다. 단속에 있어 비문제성군을 제외한 집단들에서 큰 두려움이 없는 경향을 보였고, 단속경험은 문제성위험군에서 비교적 높은 분포로 나타났다. 셋째, 전환의사에 있어 ‘방식의 간편성제고’는 저위험성군과 중위험군이 문제성 위험군보다,‘상품 다양성 제고’는 저위험군이 문제성위험군보다,‘마감시간 제고’는 저위험군이 비문제성군과 문제성위험군보다 높게 나타났다. ‘단속강화’는 비문제성군이 중위험군, 문제성위험군보다,‘처벌강화’는 비문제성군이 나머지 모든 집단보다 낮게 나타났다.",2014,임태성,한국체육학회지-인문사회과학,,,,ko,openalex_non_en:article,openalex_non_en,1,False,False,False,,,,,
R6514,대학생들의 스포츠가치관이 스포츠도박 인식 및 중독에 미치는 영향,,2014,조,,,,,,s2:Review,s2,1,False,False,False,,,,,
R6515,성인체육 편 : 대학생들의 스포츠가치관이 스포츠도박 인식 및 중독에 미치는 영향,,2014,조,,,,,,s2:Review,s2,1,False,False,False,,,,,
R6516,대학생의 스포츠토토 경험유형에 따른 도박중독 심각성에 대한 차이연구,"연구목적 본 연구는 사설 스포츠를 통한 도박 사이트 전체 가입자 중 20대 대학생이34%의 가장 높은 비율을 차지한다는 연구결과를 토대로 대학생의 사설 스포츠도박을 감소시키기 위한 방법을 모색하기 위하여, 대학생의 스포츠토토 경험유형에 따른 도박중독 심각성을 분석하였다. 특히 스마트폰의 발달을 통하여 불법 스포츠토토에 대한 접근성이 높아져 문제성도박자로 전략하는 사람들이 늘어나고 있으나 이에 연구가 부족한 실정에 있다. 이를 위해서 대학생들의 스포츠토토 경험유형에 따른 도박중독 심각성 및 그에 따른 자아존중감, 내외통제성의차이를 살펴보도록 하였다. 연구방법 서울 및 경기 지역의 대학교를 중심으로 재학 혹은 휴학하는 학생 193명(남=91, 여=102)을 대상으로 설문지를 통해 분석을 하였다. 설문지는 인구통계학적 질문, 사설 스포츠도박경험에 대한 질문, CPGI(Canadian Problem Gambling Index), 자아존중감척도(이영자,1996), 내외통제성 척도(윤유경, 1996)가 포함된 총 59문항으로 이루어져있다. 연구결과 대학생들의 스포츠토토의 구매에 대한 경험을 묻는 질문에서는 총 설문대상자 193명중 33명(17.1%)이 참여 경험이 있는 것으로 나타났다. 또한 스포츠토토 경험 유무에 따른 도박중독 수준을 알아보기 위하여 교차분석을 실시하였다. 경험자 33명 중 28명(84.8%)이 CPGI 중위험 도박 이상으로 나타났다. 반면 스포츠토토를 경험하지 않은 대학생의 경우 19명(11.9%)으로 나타나 통계적으로 유의한 수준(X2=79.081, p<.001)으로 나타났다. 반면 불법스포츠 도박 경험에 따른 도박중독 수준에 따른 교차분석에서는 통계적으로 유의한 수준의 차이는 타나나지 않았다. 가설에서 제시한 스포츠토토경험 유무에 따른 자아존중감, 내외통제성에 대한 차이를 있을 것으로 예상되었으나 t검정을 실시한 결과 통계적으로 유의한 차이를 나타내지 않았다. 기타 스포츠토토 경험에 대한 실태를 조사하였다.",2014,조성경,한국심리학회 학술대회 자료집,,,,ko,openalex_non_en:article,openalex_non_en,1,False,False,False,,,,,
R6517,포스터 발표 : 대학생 ; 대학생의 스포츠토토 경험유형에 따른 도박중독 심각성에 대한 차이연구,"연구목적 본 연구는 사설 스포츠를 통한 도박 사이트 전체 가입자 중 20대 대학생이34%의 가장 높은 비율을 차지한다는 연구결과를 토대로 대학생의 사설 스포츠도박을 감소시키기 위한 방법을 모색하기 위하여, 대학생의 스포츠토토 경험유형에 따른 도박중독 심각성을 분석하였다. 특히 스마트폰의 발달을 통하여 불법 스포츠토토에 대한 접근성이 높아져 문제성도박자로 전략하는 사람들이 늘어나고 있으나 이에 연구가 부족한 실정에 있다. 이를 위해서 대학생들의 스포츠토토 경험유형에 따른 도박중독 심각성 및 그에 따른 자아존중감, 내외통제성의차이를 살펴보도록 하였다. 연구방법 서울 및 경기 지역의 대학교를 중심으로 재학 혹은 휴학하는 학생 193명(남=91, 여=102)을 대상으로 설문지를 통해 분석을 하였다. 설문지는 인구통계학적 질문, 사설 스포츠도박경험에 대한 질문, CPGI(Canadian Problem Gambling Index), 자아존중감척도(이영자,1996), 내외통제성 척도(윤유경, 1996)가 포함된 총 59문항으로 이루어져있다. 연구결과 대학생들의 스포츠토토의 구매에 대한 경험을 묻는 질문에서는 총 설문대상자 193명중 33명(17.1%)이 참여 경험이 있는 것으로 나타났다. 또한 스포츠토토 경험 유무에 따른 도박중독 수준을 알아보기 위하여 교차분석을 실시하였다. 경험자 33명 중 28명(84.8%)이 CPGI 중위험 도박 이상으로 나타났다. 반면 스포츠토토를 경험하지 않은 대학생의 경우 19명(11.9%)으로 나타나 통계적으로 유의한 수준(X2=79.081, p<.001)으로 나타났다. 반면 불법스포츠 도박 경험에 따른 도박중독 수준에 따른 교차분석에서는 통계적으로 유의한 수준의 차이는 타나나지 않았다. 가설에서 제시한 스포츠토토경험 유무에 따른 자아존중감, 내외통제성에 대한 차이를 있을 것으로 예상되었으나 t검정을 실시한 결과 통계적으로 유의한 차이를 나타내지 않았다. 기타 스포츠토토 경험에 대한 실태를 조사하였다.",2014,조성경,,,,,ko,openalex_non_en:article,openalex_non_en,1,False,False,False,,,,,
R6518,대학생들의 스포츠가치관이 스포츠도박 인식 및 중독에 미치는 영향,"The purpose of this study was to investigate the relationship ebtween sport value and sport gambling pe-rception, cognition of college students. To fulfill this purpos,e a total of 240 college students were selected a sresearch participants, using the convenience sampling method. iFnally, 215 surveys were used for this study . Subjects were analyzed with t-test, exploratory factor analysi,s Cronbach``s α, multiple regression analysis andChi-square. The findings of this study were as follows; First, characteristic, recreational, economic values outof sub-factors of college students`` sport value had an impact on sport gambling perception. Second, collegestudents`` sport value partially effected on sport gambling addiction. Precisely, the level of characteristic, recreationalvalues had an impact on sport gambling addiction. Thir,d college students`` sport gambling perceptionaffected sport gambling addiction. The results of this study wll iprovide policy implications for the preventionof sport gambling addiction for college students.",2014,조욱연,,,,,ko,openalex:article,openalex,1,False,False,False,,,,,
R6519,성인체육 편 : 대학생들의 스포츠가치관이 스포츠도박 인식 및 중독에 미치는 영향,"The purpose of this study was to investigate the relationship ebtween sport value and sport gambling pe-rception, cognition of college students. To fulfill this purpos,e a total of 240 college students were selected a sresearch participants, using the convenience sampling method. iFnally, 215 surveys were used for this study . Subjects were analyzed with t-test, exploratory factor analysi,s Cronbach``s α, multiple regression analysis andChi-square. The findings of this study were as follows; First, characteristic, recreational, economic values outof sub-factors of college students`` sport value had an impact on sport gambling perception. Second, collegestudents`` sport value partially effected on sport gambling addiction. Precisely, the level of characteristic, recreationalvalues had an impact on sport gambling addiction. Thir,d college students`` sport gambling perceptionaffected sport gambling addiction. The results of this study wll iprovide policy implications for the preventionof sport gambling addiction for college students.",2014,조욱연,,,,,ko,openalex:article,openalex,1,False,False,False,,,,,
