R6816,程进均衡定理引理布尔代数发环〈R，＋·〉的理想,亚洲的雾霾天，岛屿，半岛，钓鱼岛，海峡两岸，气候人文环境，瓶颈问题，海基线，发足球彩票学，发波浪理论，发宇宙两门一网（根据足彩胜平负3，1，0的比赛结果规则，两队踢成平局彩果为1）呼吸道人类呼吸道高度发高度预防预测监控评级系统，经济角度验证证明解决达尔文的进化论程进均衡定理引理布尔代数发环〈R，＋·〉的理想。,2013,程进,无线互联科技,,,,zh,openalex_non_en:article,openalex_non_en,1,False,False,False,,,,,
R6817,香港居民对于非赌场类博彩的感知、态度和参与程度——一个实证研究,"非赌场类博彩(赛马、六合彩、足球彩票)在香港具有悠久的历史,并且被社区居民较好地接受。香港博彩的发展模式温和并且可持续。了解香港居民对于非赌场类博彩的参与程度和态度,有助于更好地了解中国文化背景下居民对于博彩的包容程度,以及感知影响的重要方面,对于了解博彩业对中国社会的影响有较大的意义。本研究采取质性研究方法,通过四次焦点小组访谈和23次半结构访谈了解香港居民对于本地现存博彩业的感知、态度和参与程度。研究结果总结了居民对于非赌场类博彩业的态度和感知的主要方面、居民参与博彩活动的形式和动机、居民对于博彩的期许和进一步规范与发展的建议,从客观、辨证的角度看待博彩这一现象。",2013,罗佳琦,Acta Scientiarum Naturalium Universitatis Sunyatseni,,,,zh,openalex_non_en:article,openalex_non_en,1,False,False,False,,,,,
R6818,体彩雪炭工程与学校体育场馆实施“资源共享”的研究——以临城县综合健身馆与临城第二中学体育场馆为例,"以体育彩票＂雪炭工程＂临城县综合健身馆与临城二中体育场馆实施的＂资源共享＂为研究对象,通过问卷调查和实地走访调研,论证了以雪炭工程体育场馆与学校体育场馆实行＂资源共享＂为前提的体育场馆管理方式,有利于整合体育系统和教育系统的体育设施,最大限度地发挥体育场馆为学校体育工作和全民健身工程服务的功效;为了更好地发挥雪炭工程体育场馆与学校体育场馆的合力效应,应注意合理地规划各种体育场地场馆的布局、多方筹措资金、健全安全管理制度、建立长效运行机制等,以期为我国体育场馆的有效利用提供理论参考和实践的启示。",2013,赵保丽,Acta Scientiarum Naturalium Universitatis Sunyatseni,,,,zh,openalex_non_en:article,openalex_non_en,1,False,False,False,,,,,
R6819,Studies on Predicting the Outcome of Professional Baseball Games with Data Mining Techniques: MLB as a Case,"[[abstract]]職棒比賽非常注重數據收集及分析，因此每場比賽都會產生大量可供分析的數據。資料探勘技術是一項可在浩瀚的資料中分析出關鍵結果的電腦分析技術，以此技術來處理職棒的資料，不但可獲佳效，更可免去人工分析所產生的錯誤。本研究目的即是利用資料探勘的技術預測美國大聯盟職棒賽事之勝負與得分。 本研究以美國職棒大聯盟30支隊伍在2000到2012年所有例行賽賽事為研究對象，投入之變數，為各隊賽前十場比賽野手與投手各項表現之加總平均數。首先使用「皮爾森積差相關分析」除去與勝負較無相關之變數與具有複共線性之變數，以挑選出適當之投入變數，再利用「類神經網路」中的「倒傳遞網路」將挑選出之變數投入並建立模型。以前100場作為模型之訓練集，剩下62場投入模型之鑑效，取得比賽之預測比分後，再和實際比賽結果和賭盤之盤口作比較。 實證結果利用產出之模型得到之主客隊預測比分，再與運動彩券的大小、勝分差、讓分盤口比較後，證實本研究所提出的模型有較佳的預測準確率。後續研究者或可改變投入之變數值，再代入本研究提出的模型，應可提升預測的準確率。 Professional baseball games emphasize data collection and analysis because each game provides plenty of data that needs to be analyzed. Data mining methods involve computer analysis techniques with which a crucial outcome can be found from a huge amount of data. The data mining techniques thus can be used to efficiently analyze the data of professional baseball and also avoid the mistakes often caused by manual analysis. This study aims to predict the outcome and scores of professional baseball games in MLB. The data of the study are all the regular season games from 2000 to 2012 of thirty teams in MLB. The variables are the average statistics of both the fielders’ and the pitchers’ performances in the last ten games. First, we used the Pearson product-moment correlation coefficient to delete the unrelated variables and variables of multicollinearity and to select the suitable variables. Then we applied the Back Propagation Network (BPN) of the artificial neural network to build a model for the selected variables. The first 100 games served as the training set of the model while the later 62 games as the validation set. After obtaining the predicted scores of each game, we compared them to the real outcome of the games and the money line. After using the output model to predict the scores of the host and the guest, we further compared them with the real outcome, run line, and money line of sports gambling. The experimental results have proven that the model of this study provided better prediction accuracy. Follow-up researchers may consider using different variables for the model to improve the accuracy of the predictions.",2013,馮瑞祥,Chinese Culture University Repository,,,,en,openalex:dissertation,openalex,1,False,False,False,,,,,
R6820,부산지역 대학생의 도박행동유형과 건강위험행동이 도박문제에 미치는 영향,,2013,김,,,,,,s2:,s2,1,False,False,False,,,,,
R6821,A Study on the Advancement of the China Sports Lottery and Sports Industry,,2013,김성훈,,,,,en,openalex:article | s2:,openalex;s2,2,False,False,False,,,,,
R6822,부산지역 대학생의 도박행동유형과 건강위험행동이 도박문제에 미치는 영향,"Objectives: This study aims to examine college students` gambling behavior and investigates the effect of factors on problem gambling, such as personal characteristics, gambling history, and health risk behaviors. Methods: The subjects of the study were students selected from six colleges in Busan, Korea. A total of 431 questionnaires were used in the final analysis. Results: First, the results showed that more than 60% of respondents had gambled in the past year. The most popular forms of gambling were the lottery, followed by card betting, sports betting, and online gambling, betting on horse-racing, cycle-racing, and motorboat-racing games, and casino games. Second, frequent smoking and drinking increased the incidence of the problem gambling. Third, it was revealed that gender and age were negatively correlated with gambling, while the frequency of gambling activities and the number of previous gambling experiences were positively correlated with problem gambling behavior. Conclusions: Ongoing preventive screening and early intervention must be made a priority to prevent college students` gambling behavior from reaching serious levels.",2013,김정은,Journal of Health Informatics and Statistics,,,,ko,openalex:article,openalex,1,False,False,False,,,,,
R6823,판타지스포츠 이용동기에 따른 스포츠 팬덤 형성이 스포츠 소비행동에 미치는 영향,,2013,류,,,,,,s2:Review,s2,1,False,False,False,,,,,
R6824,판타지스포츠 이용동기에 따른 스포츠 팬덤 형성이 스포츠 소비행동에 미치는 영향,"The purpose of this study was to provide managerial implications to promote for Fantasy Sports industry and sports industry after identifying the relationship between the reasons of users, fandom, and sports consumer behaviors. Survey was conducted during April 8, 2013 through April 19, 2013 from 326 college attendees in Seoul areas. Collected data was first analyzed by exploratory factor analysis, then proposed conceptual framework was tested via confirmatory factor analysis and structural equation modeling. The results were as followed: First, Fantasy-Sports User reasons had a significant effect on entertainment, competition, and fandom. Second, established fandom sports consumer behaviors had a significant effect during spectating and the sports conversation, however, not on sports-good purchasing.",2013,류동수,,,,,ko,openalex:article,openalex,1,False,False,False,,,,,
R6825,"레저,스포츠 : 스포츠토토의 중독성향과 합리화 기제; Sykes와 Matza의 중화이론 관점으로",,2013,서,,,,,,s2:,s2,1,False,False,False,,R6827,,,
R6826,스포츠토토의 중독성향과 합리화 기제,,2013,서,,,,,,s2:,s2,1,False,False,False,,,,,
R6827,"레저,스포츠 : 스포츠토토의 중독성향과 합리화 기제; Sykes와 Matza의 중화이론 관점으로","The purpose of this study was to elucidate the addiction of gambling, one of the deviations that are considered a social problem which are related to sports gambling. Furthermore, this study aimed to examine the propensity of addiction that is inherent in Sports Toto, and al so conduct an in-depth study the rationalization of addiction to Sports Toto in relevance to the views of the neutralization theory by Sykes and Matza(1957). For this, this study used case study a methods of qualitative research. Participants were selected by using purposive sampling. Data was collected through in-depth interviews and collecting relevant data. The collected data was put in a test analysis. The study results is as follows. First, the propensity of addiction that was noticed by Sports Toto constituents were seen through, betting whenever money was available, belief in making a fortune at stroke， a tenacity for probabilities, difficulties during everyday life that come from resistance, and participating in a dangerous sport. Constituents had trust in the belief that it was able to earn a large sum of money through Sports Toto and so were betting their money in a world of hope, and showed a tendency to invest their money in Sports Toto whenever they had the appropriate amount.",2013,서병진,,,,,ko,openalex:article,openalex,1,False,False,False,,R6825,,,
R6828,스포츠토토의 중독성향과 합리화 기제,"The purpose of this study was to elucidate the addiction of gambling, one of the deviations that are considered a social problem which are related to sports gambling. Furthermore, this study aimed to examine the propensity of addiction that is inherent in Sports Toto, and al so conduct an in-depth study the rationalization of addiction to Sports Toto in relevance to the views of the neutralization theory by Sykes and Matza(1957). For this, this study used case study a methods of qualitative research. Participants were selected by using purposive sampling. Data was collected through in-depth interviews and collecting relevant data. The collected data was put in a test analysis. The study results is as follows. First, the propensity of addiction that was noticed by Sports Toto constituents were seen through, betting whenever money was available, belief in making a fortune at stroke， a tenacity for probabilities, difficulties during everyday life that come from resistance, and participating in a dangerous sport. Constituents had trust in the belief that it was able to earn a large sum of money through Sports Toto and so were betting their money in a world of hope, and showed a tendency to invest their money in Sports Toto whenever they had the appropriate amount.",2013,서병진,,,,,ko,openalex:article,openalex,1,False,False,False,,,,,
