R7226,我国体育彩票问题彩民现状调查——以上海、广州、郑州、沈阳、成都为例,"彩票机构要承担和履行更多的社会责任,发扬彩票发行的正面影响、遏制负面影响,其中很重要的一点就是对问题彩民、潜在问题彩民进行有效的甄别与救助。研究初步制定出了适合我国国情的问题彩民甄别量表,通过对5个城市的调查较全面地了解了我国体育彩票问题彩民的现状,并在调查基础上提出了对策建议：完善体育彩票游戏规则;加大体育彩票公益宣传力度;加强对彩民购彩的正确引导;构建彩民救助机制。",2011,Li,Acta Scientiarum Naturalium Universitatis Sunyatseni,,,,zh,openalex_non_en:article,openalex_non_en,1,False,False,False,,,,,
R7227,Quantitative Research on Consumers' Cognitive Bias in Consumption of Sports Lottery,"Using the method of questionnaire investigation,the present paper discussed the consumers' bias in sports lottery consumption and its influence over gambling behavior.It concluded that most of sports lottery consumers are young people of middle and low income with better education and short period of lottery consumption;the general cognition of the consumers is good and the consumers on the whole are rational in lottery buying but there are still some problem consumers;nearly sixty percent of consumers have preference to cold or hot numbers and there exist vast differences in superstition;cognitive bias has significant influence over lottery buying,which in turn results in the internal psychological mechanism of problem gambling behavior.",2011,Lin-juan,Shanghai Tiyu Xueyuan xuebao,,,,en,openalex:article | s2:,openalex;s2,2,False,False,False,,,,,
