R7377,Differences in the Associations between Gambling Problem Severity and Psychiatric Disorders among Black and White Adults: Findings from the National Epidemiologic Survey on Alcohol and Related Conditions,"We examined differences in the associations of gambling problem severity and psychiatric disorders among a nationally representative sample of 32,316 black and white adults. Black respondents were more likely than white ones to exhibit problem or pathological gambling (PPG) and a stronger relationship between subsyndromal gambling and any mood disorder, hypomania, and any substance use disorder. Differences in the patterns of co-occurring disorders between syndromal and particularly subsyndromal levels of gambling in black and white respondents indicate the importance of considering race-related factors in mental health prevention and treatment strategies.",2010,Barry,American Journal on Addictions,10.1111/j.1521-0391.2010.00098.x,21175923,https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1521-0391.2010.00098.x,en,citations:article,citations,1,True,False,False,reference of Tran 2024,,,,
R7378,Gambling problem severity and psychiatric disorders among Hispanic and white adults: findings from a nationally representative sample,,2010,Barry,Journal of Psychiatric Research,10.1016/j.jpsychires.2010.07.010,20800852,https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jpsychires.2010.07.010,en,citations:article,citations,1,True,False,False,reference of Tran 2024,,,,
R7379,"Software Contracts: Law, Practice and Precedents","This major textbook covers the commercial contracts relating to shipping, addressing the sale, finance and carriage contracts as a single commercial transaction. The new second edition focuses less on the technological advances that may evolve via the internet and more on how real world principles apply to e-commerce and the emerging body of e-commerce case law. It covers all new regulations and legislation, including relevant EU directives and new case law. New content in this edition includes developments in online betting, electronic conveyancing and online dispute resolution as well as the changes introduced by the new Companies Act. The text is supported by appendices containing sample trade forms and by relevant statutory materials . Well-organised and original, this title will be of great practical use to all practitioners wishing to take a fresh and new look at the law of shipment sales.",2010,Bond,Medical Entomology and Zoology,,,,en,openalex:book | s2:,openalex;s2,2,False,False,False,,,,,
