R7657,An Analytic Recall of the Sports Lottery Legislation in China,"Since 1994,sports lottery business has been developing very fast.Though we have made great achievements in this field,there are some problems like 4.20 Incident in Hubei province,and case of sports lottery in Shenzhen,which have aroused our attention and meditation.Certainly,many causes lead to the cases,among which the postponed legislation apparently blocks the development of it.Therefore,it’s necessary to give an analytic recall of the sports lottery legislation in the expectation of regularizing and standardizing the lottery market.",2009,Tang,Journal of Hunan University of Commerce,,,,en,openalex:article | s2:,openalex;s2,2,False,False,False,,,,,
R7658,Sportwetten in Deutschland,"Glücksspiel ist ein enormer Wirtschaftsfaktor. Insbesondere Sportwetten werden immer beliebter. Ihnen haften jedoch auch ernstzunehmende Spielsuchtgefahren an, die den Gesetzgeber bislang veranlasst haben, die Veranstaltung von Sportwetten einem Staatsmonopol zu unterstellen.",2009,Thaysen,Nomos eBooks,10.5771/9783845217406,,https://doi.org/10.5771/9783845217406,de,openalex_non_en:book,openalex_non_en,1,False,False,False,,R1306,,,
