R7726,An Analysis of Sports Lottery Buyers of Shanxi Province,"This paper carries out a questionnaire survey in selected cities and counties of Shanxi,researches about the constitution of sports lottery buyers and their lottery-buying thoughts and behavior,compares with some results from other related surveys,analyses the present sports lottery buyers market of Shanxi,and puts forth some countermeasures and suggestions.",2008,Dong-feng,Journal of North University of China,,,,en,openalex:article | s2:Review,openalex;s2,2,False,False,False,,,,,
R7727,Fantasy sports communities on the internet,,2008,Draper,Michigan State University,10.25335/m5gt5ft2p,,https://doi.org/10.25335/m5gt5ft2p,und,datacite:Text/Dissertation | openaire:Doctoral thesis,datacite;openaire,2,False,True,False,,,,,
R7728,Gambling Behavior Among College Student-Athletes,"Analyzing data from a representative sample of 20,739 U.S. college student-athletes, this study sought to determine whether certain student-athletes were more prone to frequent or problem gambling behavior. Relative to other studies of college students, a lower percentage of National Collegiate Athletic Association (NCAA) student-athletes reported gambling (males 62.4%, females 43%) and having gambling problems (males 4.3%, females 0.4%), but a high prevalence of weekly gambling was reported (males 13.0%, females 3.3%). Male student-athletes in high profile sports (e.g., baseball, football) were more likely to report a gambling-related problem compared to their counterparts in other sports (e.g., track & field, volleyball). Sports wagering remains a cause for concern. Only a very small number of student athletes reported major infractions such as attempting to alter the outcome of a game or sharing inside information. Future research should investigate why certain student-athletes are more prone to develop gambling problems.",2008,Ellenbogen,Journal of Applied Sport Psychology,10.1080/10413200802056685,,https://doi.org/10.1080/10413200802056685,en,openaire:Article | openalex:article | s2:,openalex;s2;openaire,3,False,False,False,,,,,
