R7752,Special Issue: Sport finance and gambling.,"Gambling on sports is a big business, and in North America it has evolved during the past few decades from a shady, quasi-legal activity to a widely accepted recreational activity. As with any big business, gambling on sports has a number of important financial and economic implications. This special issue of the International Journal of Sport Finance explores several important financial and economic issues related to sports gambling.",2008,Humphreys,International Journal of Sport Finance,,,,en,openalex:article,openalex,1,False,False,False,,,,,
R7753,Liaoning Sports Industry on the Revitalization of Old Industrial Bases in the Contribution Rate,"By reference of literature and experts interviewed,this paper analyzes the contribution rate which Liaoning Sports Industry to promote the old industrial base,discusses about Liaoning sports development strategy in industry promotion.This research consider that the contribution rate which Sports Industry to the old industrial base promotion is manifested in sports equipment manufacturing industry,sports service industry,sports tourism,sports lottery and so on.The main strategy of developing Sports Industry includes: Giving free rein to the advantages of sports manufacturing industry and making the Liaoning brand;Speeding up the sports service industry development and stimulating sports consumer market;Building a good investment condition of Sports Industry and promoting the social employment rate.",2008,Jiang,Journal of Harbin Institute of Physical Education,,,,en,openalex:article | s2:,openalex;s2,2,False,False,False,,,,,
