R7770,"Just for Sport!? Sport, Gambling and Politics in Israel","By adopting a developmental approach, this essay describes and analyses the key processes that led to the establishment and institutionalization of sports gambling in Israel. The socio-historic examination of these processes (1951–1971) suggests that sports gambling in Israel was primarily designed to satisfy a convergence of political interests among governmental decision-makers, leaders of sports institutions and powerful private entrepreneurs.",2008,Levy,The International Journal of the History of Sport,10.1080/09523360802500113,,https://doi.org/10.1080/09523360802500113,en,openaire:Article | openalex:article | s2:,openalex;s2;openaire,3,False,False,False,,,,,
R7771,Legal Consideration on Sport Lottery from the Case of Xi'an BMW,"From the case of Xi'an BMW and using the method of literature,this paper found out that correlative laws and regulations were imperfect,the issue of distribution,sale and monitoring on sport lottery have raised.It proposed that the formulation of lottery law and implementation manual should be setup,the nation lottery monitoring commission and office should be established,the system reform of sport lottery should be carried out,the qualification certification of practical personnel should be built up.The main purpose is to provide the theoretical reference and healthy development in sport lottery market.",2008,Li,Bulletin of Sport Science & Technology,,,,en,openalex:article | s2:,openalex;s2,2,False,False,False,,,,,
R7772,Research on Marketing Strategy Emphasizing Relation to Lottery-ticket-buyers of Shanghai Computer Sports Lottery Tickets Selling Net-Points,"Using the methods of literature,consulting experts,questionnaire etc.,based on a theoretical analysis of the connotation,gradations and nature of the marketing emphasizing the relation to lottery-ticket-buyers and according to the present investigated condition,it brought forward the following marketing strategy emphasizing the relation to the lottery-ticket-buyers of Shanghai computer sports lottery tickets selling net-points: rational and fine gradation of lottery-ticket-buyers,strengthening the interchange with them in ideas;creating greater value for them;strengthening the construction of the credit in the marketing of sports lottery tickets selling net-points;and making the relation of sports lottery tickets selling net-points with lottery-ticket-buyers change to the structure relation.",2008,Li,Shanghai Tiyu Xueyuan xuebao,,,,en,openalex:article | s2:,openalex;s2,2,False,False,False,,,,,
