R7793,A Cyclical Learning Process Under Uncertainty - The Spanish Soccer Betting Game Evidence,"Based on the well established result of probability matching, we explore in this paper to what extent soccer bettors adjust their behavior taking into account the new relevant information provided by the market. We test empirically the existence of a learning process using the Quiniela bettors' performance, the Spanish soccer betting game, for the period 1970-2000. Empirical results suggest that there is a progressive improvement in the bettors' performance attributable to the learning process. The other remaining explanatory variables follow the expected behavior.",2008,Pujol,Elsevier BV,10.2139/ssrn.1128842,,https://doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.1128842,en,crossref:posted-content | openaire:Article; Other literature type | openalex:preprint | s2:,openalex;s2;crossref;openaire,4,False,False,False,,,,,
R7794,Development and Prospect of Sports Lottery from the Period of Section Lottery to the Period of State Lottery in China,"The sports lottery has been experienced the period of section lottery and the period of state lottery in China,and has a great progress in its period,but it has been poorer than the development of other developed countries,and has some lacks.Through the retrospect of the two periods,these had been some questions such as construction of system,management of market,publicity,and so on.In the meantime,the article outlooks the prospect of sports lottery development in China from the aspects in terms of lottery market,net and technology,economical basis,and so on.And some powerful measures offered are used for the development of sports lottery to the questions.",2008,Qi-zheng,Journal of Chengdu University,,,,en,openalex:article | s2:,openalex;s2,2,False,False,False,,,,,
