R7832,Study on the Sports Lottery from the Humanism Angle In China,"Through the documentation,comprehensive analysis and other methods,sports lottery is studied from the humanism angle in China.The study find out that there is short of commonweal,lottery environment is not perfect,lag of statutes,deflection propagandize direction.The paper also put forward the countermeasures of enhance commonweal idea,quicken lottery egislation,open up propagandize view,reform the mode to convenience civilian and so on.",2008,Yang,,,,,en,openalex:article | s2:,openalex;s2,2,False,False,False,,,,,
R7833,Comparative research on sport lottery regulations in China and foreign countries,"The supervision system and regulations of sport lottery in China were compared with those in America and France by using the method of literature study and comparative analysis.It was pointed out that there existed many problems in China's lottery industry,compared with America and France which had perfect operation systems.Therefore,the legislation procedure should be accelerated and the Lottery Law should be implemented.In addition,the development tendency of the sport lottery industry in China was predicted from aspects of sales,management style,legal systems construction and lottery categories.",2008,Yi,Wuhan Ti-Yuan xuebao,,,,en,openalex:article | s2:,openalex;s2,2,False,False,False,,,,,
R7834,办好体彩 造福民众 支持奥运——谈体育彩票文件与档案管理的创新,中国体育彩票，是取之于民，用之于民的新兴行业。购买体彩，奉献爱心，造福民众，支持奥运，这反映了体彩对社会带来的巨大益处，对我国办好北京奥运会并取得优异成绩具有重大的推动作用。同时，体彩对中国体育事业的发展，特别是对竞技体育后备人才培养，提供了很大的帮助。,2008,Ying,少年体育训练,,,,zh,openalex_non_en:article,openalex_non_en,1,False,False,False,,,,,
R7835,The Current Situation of and Measures to the Legislation of the Sports Lottery in Our Country,"This paper gives a review to the current situation of how the sports lottery laws were made and then,gives an analysis of the problems existing in them,finding that the function of the government,the sorts of the goods and the distribution of the public welfare fund are not properly arranged.In regard with them,some measures are advised in the paper.The purpose of it is to normalize the management of the sports lottery market,and at the meantime to make some preparations for the sports lottery law-making in our country.",2008,Yuan-sheng,Journal of Huaihua University,,,,en,openalex:article | s2:Review,openalex;s2,2,False,False,False,,,,,
