R7837,Thinking on Cracking down New-type Gamble by Strengthening the Cooperation Between Hong Kong and Macao,"At present,such new types of gambles as marksix,soccer gambling and network gambling introduced from Hong Kong and Macao tend to spread and seriously endanger the law and danger of society.In order to strictly crack down this new type of crimes,we should strengthen the cooperation with Hong Kong and Macao,take effective measures and form striking resultant forces.",2008,Zhang,,,,,en,openalex:article | s2:,openalex;s2,2,False,False,False,,,,,
