R7876,Some Suggestions on the Issuing Purpose and Rule Design for the Single-match Toto in China,"During the next half of 2005,China has planned the issue of the Jackpot Single Match Toto.This paper mainly discusses its issuing necessity,issuing purpose and rules.As football gambling is becoming more and more popular,this Toto may satisfy the recreational demands of the people,especially the football fans,increase the public funds gained from the lottery,and keep the illegal football gambling within limits.However,the author believes the ultimate issuing purpose of this Toto should be minimizing the harm brought by people’s special recreational demand.Meanwhile,the concrete rule design of this Toto on the decision of the odds,the matching teams,means of gambling and buying and the use of the public funds from it is discussed in the paper,and some other important issues such as the marketing and promotion of this Toto in its issuing process are also proposed.",2007,Gang,Journal of Capital Institute of Physical Education,,,,en,openalex:article | s2:,openalex;s2,2,False,False,False,,,,,
