R7888,On the Advantages and Potentials of the Development of Beijing Sports Industry in View of the Comparison between China and Foreign Countries,"Sports goods manufacture and sports lottery marketing in Beijing are far behind Guangdong.The operation of large scale events and sports agency in Beijing is behind Shanghai.Compared with London,the output value per year of sports industry and average sports consumption in Beijing are lower than London.As Chinese political and cultural center,Beijing develops quickly in economy.With a long history,the holding of 2008 Olympic Games,well-equipped sports facilities,many universities and research centers,and the support of different districts,Beijing possesses unique advantages and potentials of developing sports industries.To make good use of these advantages,sports economic policies need to be perfected.The development of sports industry should be connected with the development of competitive sports and sports for all.Recreation should become the core of sports industry.",2007,Jin-xia,Beijing Tiyu Daxue xuebao,,,,en,openalex:article | s2:,openalex;s2,2,False,False,False,,,,,
