R8041,Researching on the Basic Legislation Principles of Chinese Sport Lottery,"The law case on sport lottery was called one trouble fallen, another.Lacking of full and systematic sport lottery law contribute to these incidents. The author makes a simple research on the basic principle of sport lottery legislation in China by literature, interviewing experts, which is possible to provide some references for sport lottery legislation.",2005,Di-fu,,,,,en,openalex:article | s2:,openalex;s2,2,False,False,False,,,,,
R8042,The Market Impact of Trends and Sequences in Performance: New Evidence,"ABSTRACT Bloomfield and Hales (2002) find strong evidence that experimental market subjects are influenced by trends and patterns in a manner supportive of the shifting regimes model of Barberis, Shleifer, and Vishny (1998) . We subject the model to further empirical scrutiny using the football wagering market as our price laboratory. Sports betting markets have several advantages over traditional capital markets as an empirical setting, and commonalities with traditional markets allow for useful insights. We find scant evidence that investors behave in accordance with the model.",2005,Durham,The Journal of Finance,10.1111/j.1540-6261.2005.00807.x,,https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1540-6261.2005.00807.x,en,openalex:article | s2:,openalex;s2,2,False,False,False,,R8170,,,
R8043,Betting On Horse Racing for Dummies,"How to enjoy a day at the races-and bet to win! The last two years have seen a record number of Americans tune in for climatic Triple Crown races featuring Smarty Jones and Funny Cide; in 2004, television viewership jumped a whopping 61 percent over the record set in 2003, and the Belmont Stakes race itself drew a record crowd of more than 120,000! This easy-to-understand guide shows first-time visitors to the track how to enjoy the sport of horse racing-and make smart bets. It explains what goes on at the track, what to look for in horses and jockeys, how to read a racing form and do simple handicapping, and how to manage betting funds and make wagers that stand a good chance of paying off. Complete with coverage of off-track and online betting, it's just what anyone needs to play the ponies-and win! Richard Eng (Las Vegas, NV) is a racing writer and handicapper for the Las Vegas Review-Journal, a columnist for the Daily Racing Form, and the host of a horseracing radio program in Las Vegas. He was formerly a part of the ABC Sports team that covered the Triple Crown.",2005,Eng,,,,,en,openalex:book,openalex,1,False,False,False,,,,,
R8044,College Football Rankings and Market Efficiency,"The results in this paper show that various college football ranking sys-tems have useful independent information for predicting the outcomes of games. Optimal weights for the systems are estimated, and the use of these weights produces a predictive system that is more accurate than any of the individual systems. The results also provide a fairly precise estimate of the size of the home field advantage. These results may be of interest to the Bowl Championship Series in choosing which teams to play in the national championship game. The results also show, however, that none of the systems, including the optimal combination, contains any useful information that is not in the final Las Vegas point spread. It is argued in the paper that this is a fairly strong test of the efficiency of the college football betting market. 1",2005,Fair,,,,,en,openalex:article,openalex,1,False,False,False,,R7870,,,
R8045,Odds-setters as forecasters: the case of the football betting market,,2005,Forrest,Lancaster EPrints (Lancaster University),,,,en,openalex:article | s2:,openalex;s2,2,False,False,False,,,,,
R8046,Efficiency of football betting markets: the economic significance of trading strategies,"Prior studies of the Australian Rugby League betting market report a degree of predictability well in excess of that attributable to chance. However, two important recent changes in the structure of the market facilitate an unambiguous assessment of the statistical significance of predictability and the economic significance of returns to betting strategies. The present paper reexamines the efficiency of the Australian Rugby League betting market under the revised market structure. In addition, a set of measures of the economic significance of trading strategies are developed and implemented. Relative to prior studies, the out-of-sample success of the predictive model has diminished notably under the revised market structure; although a naïve strategy betting on home underdogs still performs significantly better than can be attributed to chance. Simulation experiments suggest that the documented level of predictability from several strategies generates economically significant returns.",2005,Gray,Accounting and Finance,10.1111/j.1467-629x.2004.00129.x,,https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1467-629x.2004.00129.x,en,crossref:journal-article | openaire:Article | openalex:article | s2:,openalex;s2;crossref;openaire,4,False,False,False,,,,,
R8047,Feasibility study of adjusting the allocation of sports lottery revenue,"After a period of time of rapid growth, the sales volume of sports lottery in China has recently entered a relative steady stagnant period.The main reasons for such stagnation are simple game rules and low money return rate.In order to expand the sales volume,we must create new ideas and innovate actively,so as to bring new energy and content to sports lottery.It is conductive to the development of sports lottery undertaking to readjust the proportion of allocation of sports lottery revenue and to increase money return rate.",2005,Hai,journal of physical education,,,,en,openalex:article | s2:,openalex;s2,2,False,False,False,,,,,
