R8073,Hazards and causes and countermeasures against underground soccer gambling in Guangdong,"The authors studies the phenomenon of underground soccer gambling in Shenzhen,Guangzhou,Zhuhai,Zhanjiang,Dongguan,Foshan,Shaoguan,Jiangmen,Shantou,Chaozhou,Meizhou and Zhaoqing,and analyzed its genesis,current situation and hazards, as well as the causes of its rampancy, so as to provide some countermeasures for relevant departments to sweep underground soccer gambling.",2005,Wang,journal of physical education,,,,en,openalex:article | s2:,openalex;s2,2,False,False,False,,,,,
R8074,Mode of spending of sports lottery welfare fund in China,"By carrying out statistical analysis on sports lottery issuance revenue in China all these years, the authors considered that target deviation exists in the spending of sports lottery welfare funds in China: firstly, the fund has been spent more on rich units than on poor units; secondly, the result of spending is not noticeable. Based on such an analysis coupled with the modes of spending of sports lottery welfare fund in foreign countries, the authors re-orientated the mode of spending of sports lottery welfare fund in China: Meeting the need for interest of other welfare undertakings by handing over the fund to the Ministry of Finance can not only be acceptance to the public but also meet the need for developing sports undertakings.",2005,Xi-qun,journal of physical education,,,,en,openalex:article | s2:,openalex;s2,2,False,False,False,,,,,
R8075,Ideas on the Development of China Sport Lottery Industry,"This article analyses some main problems of China sport lottery industry by looking up document and logical analysis.It indicates that we should reform our sport lottery industry in the area of issue,management regulations and laws.Finally,it makes some suggestions on the divelopment of China sport lottery industry.",2005,Xiang-qing,,,,,en,openalex:article | s2:,openalex;s2,2,False,False,False,,,,,
R8076,Research of Sports Lottery Business Management Information Design,"The lottery information management on the traditional meaning can be used to collect, store, total data and view the function which is presented. It cannot meet the demand of the new circumstance. The construction of lottery business management information is the process of management and rebuild based on the application of information technology. The business management system should be designed by the thought of ERP.",2005,Yong,,,,,en,openalex:article | s2:,openalex;s2,2,False,False,False,,,,,
R8077,A study of sports lottery knowing and purchase psychology based on SPA,"A study of sports lottery and purchase psychology was conducted in the form of literature review and questionnaire in ten cities like Beijing, Shanghai, etc and in Zhejiang Normal University. The analysis of the data collected at random indicated that the subjects did not have adequate theoretical knowing of sport lottery as a whole and that their purposes of purchasing were combination of winning a prize and concerning about sports games. Therefore, moderate prize helps enhance the interest of buying lotteries, and meanwhile, it is necessary to promote and popularize the basic knowledge of sports lottery.",2005,Zhang,Journal of Zhejiang Normal University,,,,en,openalex:article | s2:Review,openalex;s2,2,False,False,False,,,,,
