R8117,迷途的“宝马”——西安“体育彩票案”侦破始末,"曾一度震惊国人、沸沸扬扬的西安体彩案暴露出的体彩发行中的种种漏洞发人深省。然而,在喧嚣的背后,你可曾真正了解幕后的真相?迷途的宝马,首次从公安侦破的角度,以大量翔实的第一手材料,深层次披露了全案始末,对涉案的各色人等作了鞭辟入里的剖析,在铺天盖地的新闻报道中独树一帜,读后令人耳目一新,具有相当的警示作用。",2004,Hu,啄木鸟,,,,zh,openalex_non_en:article,openalex_non_en,1,False,False,False,,,,,
R8118,Issues Related to Sports Gambling,"Summary This paper looks at various issues that are of interest to the sports gambler. First, an expression is obtained for the distribution of the final bankroll using fixed wagers with a specified initial bankroll. Second, fixed percentage wagers are considered where the Kelly method is extended to the case of simultaneous bets placed at various odds; a computational algorithm is presented to obtain the Kelly fractions. Finally, the paper considers the problem of determining whether a gambling system is profitable based on the historical results of bets placed at various odds.",2004,Insley,Australian & New Zealand Journal of Statistics,10.1111/j.1467-842x.2004.00326.x,,https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1467-842x.2004.00326.x,en,crossref:journal-article | openaire:Article | openalex:article | s2:,openalex;s2;crossref;openaire,4,False,False,False,,,,,
