R8210,A strategic research on sustainble development of sports lottery tickets in Henan Province,"Adopting the method of investication, questionnare, statistic, documentation and comparing analysis,the author analyzes systematically and studies present conditions, trend of development, and provides the game plan for solving the questions in the sustainble development. The studies show that it is necessary to perfect its structure which is suitable for socialistic market economy,and make it circulate under the law. Also,we should pay attention to the propaganda,correct people's attitudes and decorate market network of sports lottery tickets.Further more,it is also important to found the lottery club,vary its product and method, and lauch deeper advertising campaign.Through all these,the sports lottery tickets can be attractive to the public.",2003,Yan,journal of physical education,,,,en,openalex:article | s2:,openalex;s2,2,False,False,False,,,,,
R8211,The Countermeasures in Marketing Exploration of China's Sports Industry,"To explore the state sports industry, the government should grasp its correct developing trend, emphasize sports market fostering and management, establish economic policy favorable for the development of sports industry, support the sports industry departments in finance and tax, and pay attention to the ranks construction. For the sports industry, it is necessary to promote the healthy development of sports competition and performing industry, prioritize the body building and entertainment industry, as well as sports lottery industry and sports manager system, perfect the management of palaestra, and explore sports intangible assets and sports products industry.",2003,Yang,Journal of Southwest Jiaotong University,,,,en,openalex:article | s2:,openalex;s2,2,False,False,False,,,,,
R8212,"On the protection of sports lottery by Criminal Law as seen from ""April20 Sports Lottery Case","The authors study the most controversial issues in the April20 Sports Lottery Case on the basis of the Criminal Law.In China,perfect protection in sports lottery by Criminal Law has been established.Sports lottery,considered as production and management in the Criminal Law,should be protected through prompt and effective measures to stop actions harmful to the sports lottery.Connotation of violation in drawing the lottery in public and announcing the winners is defined.Crimes including controlling the lottery drawing in order to occupying the money award of the lottery issuers,abuse of authority and of duty of state personnel leading to other peoples destruction of the lottery issuing are defined.",2003,Yi,Wuhan Ti-Yuan xuebao,,,,en,openalex:article | s2:,openalex;s2,2,False,False,False,,,,,
R8213,On law system about sports lottery in China,"At present, China lottery market is run by two departments. One is civil administration organs, which issue the welfare lottery; and the other is sport departments, which respond the sport lottery. The fact that up to the present there is no rule and law for lottery shows that its managements lag behind its practice. It is necessary to speed up the legislation for lottery and strengthen the government's supervision to market so as to ensure the proper rights and benefits of lotterymen and to keep the sustained development of China lottery.",2003,Yu,journal of physical education,,,,en,openalex:article | s2:,openalex;s2,2,False,False,False,,,,,
