R8308,Study on Problems Existing in the Sports Industry of China,"Research on puzzles and problems existing in the sports industry has been made. It is concluded that operation and development of our sports industry has sorts of problems: deficiency in products connected with sports clubs, uniformity of sports lottery, lack of sports agents and so on. Based on these they suggest some corresponding solutions.",2001,Xu,,,,,en,openalex:article | s2:,openalex;s2,2,False,False,False,,,,,
