R8347,체육진흥투표권 잠재소비자 태도 조사,"The main purpose of this study was to a Attitude of Sports Pools of Hidden Consumer who professional football's spectator customers. For this purpose, the population was the customers who are belonging to the Professional Football's Spectators as of 1999. Sampling was made according to the stratified random method. The participants in the questionnaire were 300, but the data for actual analysis included 281. This research instruments pretested and proved that contain content validity and reliability(a =.8874). The adapted statistics analysis methods were Frequency Analysis, t-TEST(One-Sample T test) and One-way ANOVA (LSD).The major findings of this study were summarized as followings. 1. A Recognition of Sports Poos Game not differ by sex and age, but differ by attendance frequence as spectator's and level of spectator's satisfaction. 2. A Cognitive of necessity for the Sports Poos Game not differ by sex, age and attendance frequence of spectator, but differ by spectator's satisfaction. 3. An Estimation on the Effect of the Sports Poos Game not differ by sex and age but differ by attendance frequence as spectator's and level of spectator's satisfaction. 4. An Intention to the paticipaction of the Sports Poos Game not differ by sex but differ by age, attendance frequence as spectator's, level of spectator's satisfaction.",2000,정영남,,,,,ko,openalex:article,openalex,1,False,False,False,,,,,
