R8367,"199 News, May 1998","An issue of 199 News for May 1998. This issue includes: From The Editor's Desk, Obituaries, President's Report, Labour Council Delegate's Report, Vice President's Report, Recreation Committee Report, Retired Worker's Report, Pension Report, Shop Committee Report Maintenance Skilled Trades, Ed Learn Ford And Unit Council Report, Fightback Committee Report, Peace and Disarmament Committee Report, Convention Report, Zone 17 Report, GM - Zone 15 Report, Will The War Ever End?, Women's Advocate Report, GM - Union Counsellor's Report, Globalization And Solidarity, This Month's Retirees, Human Rights Committee Report, Gambling On Sports Can Be A Stimulus To Violence in The Family, Gm - Vice Chairperson's Report, Chairperson's Report.",1998,UAW,Brock University Digital Repository (Brock University),,,,en,openalex:other,openalex,1,False,False,False,,,,,
R8368,战胜新困难 打开新局面 努力推进我省社会福利有奖募捐工作,"一、1997年度全省社会福利有奖募捐工作的主要成绩自1997年4月份接中募委通知暂停福利彩票销售活动后直至年底,全国一年实际上只销售了3个多月时间的福利彩票。尽管如此,我省有奖募捐工作仍取得可观成绩:全省共发行福利彩票15200万元,实际销售14200万元,这是来之不易的。实际上,全省已经面对95、96年体育彩票“溢价销售”、“转包承包”、“市场疲软”等许多困难,加之不少企业效益不佳,职工收入明显减少、体育及其他各种彩票接连出台等情况,使有奖募捐工作面临严峻形势,为了冲破重重难关,走出低迷,各地积极规划、主动请战、早抓早出效益,从而取得了主动权。",1998,秦细龙,社会工作,,,,zh,openalex_non_en:article,openalex_non_en,1,False,False,False,,,,,
